OL,3,GNEWSAParking struggles leave businesses
OL,4,Awanting change in medieval town
OL,5,
OL,6,FFinding a parking spot in a medieval
OL,7,Ftourist town that is almost entirely
OL,8,Fencircled by England's longest river is
OL,9,Fno easy job.
OL,11,FParking capacity in this town is often
OL,12,Fchallenging during the summer months,
OL,13,Fnot just for me but plenty of drivers,
OL,14,Fespecially when events are taking
OL,15,Fplace.
OL,17,FCould there be better news to come? A
OL,18,Freview into how, and where, shoppers
OL,19,Fand tourists park when they visit
OL,20,FShrewsbury and the wider county is
OL,21,Fbeing carried out by Shropshire
OL,22,FCouncil.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,358,350,200,160,0,100
